        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Express <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5(5^2) \\times 5^4]</span> as a base raised to a single exponent.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Express [MATH: 5(5^2) \\times 5^4] as a base raised to a single exponent.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we write\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5(5^2) = 5^1 \\times 5^2.]</span></p><p>So our expression can be written as\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5^1 \\times 5^2 \\times 5^4]</span></p><p>To multiply powers of the same base, we simply add the exponents:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5^1 \\times 5^2 \\times 5^4 = 5^{1+2+4} = 5^7]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we write\n[MATH: 5(5^2) = 5^1 \\times 5^2.]\n\nSo our expression can be written as\n[MATH: 5^1 \\times 5^2 \\times 5^4]\n\nTo multiply powers of the same base, we simply add the exponents:\n[MATH: 5^1 \\times 5^2 \\times 5^4 = 5^{1+2+4} = 5^7]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nExpress [MATH: 5(5^2) \\times 5^4] as a base raised to a single exponent.\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, we write\n[MATH: 5(5^2) = 5^1 \\times 5^2.]\n\nSo our expression can be written as\n[MATH: 5^1 \\times 5^2 \\times 5^4]\n\nTo multiply powers of the same base, we simply add the exponents:\n[MATH: 5^1 \\times 5^2 \\times 5^4 = 5^{1+2+4} = 5^7]"
      },
